@@@ note
The check runs against the unprefixed line, so it still fires inside a list item — where an
unescaped dash would open a *nested* list rather than a sibling one. See #6.

@@@ input
- alpha bravo charlie delta - echo foxtrot golf.

@@@ wrap 80
- alpha bravo charlie delta - echo foxtrot golf.

@@@ wrap 15
- alpha bravo
  charlie delta
  \- echo
  foxtrot golf.

@@@ unwrap
- alpha bravo charlie delta - echo foxtrot golf.
